6:12 SMP516 `asyncio.iscoroutinefunction()` is deprecated since Python 3.14 and also accepts the legacy coroutine marker [unsafe fix: Call `inspect.iscoroutinefunction()`]
--- fixed (1 applied, 0 remaining) ---
import asyncio
import inspect


def check(task):
    return inspect.iscoroutinefunction(task) or inspect.isfunction(task)


async def pause():
    await asyncio.sleep(0)
